<title>USA: N.J. Senate panel to review school funding plans.</title>
<headline>N.J. Senate panel to review school funding plans.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Jersey Senate Education Committee will meet Friday to review proposals to revamp the state's method of paying for public schools.</p>
<p>New Jersey is facing a Dec 31 court-imposed deadline to pass legislation designed to equalize spending on public education between rich and poor school districts.</p>
<p>The Senate committee also set a second meeting on the issue for Nov 18, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
